OL,3,GNEWSATracey Emin plan for derelict
OL,4,AMargate pavilion approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission has been granted to
OL,7,Ftransform a disused Margate pavilion,
OL,8,Fowned by artist Tracey Emin.
OL,10,FWestbrook Loggia on the Kent town's
OL,11,Fseafront has been vacant for years.
OL,13,FIt is now set to become an arts and
OL,14,Fcommunity space, with a cafe,
OL,15,Frestaurant, artist studio and sauna,
OL,16,Fafter Thanet District Council greenlit
OL,17,Fthe development by the Tracey Emin
OL,18,FFoundation.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
