OL,3,GNEWSATracey Emin plan for derelict
OL,4,AMargate pavilion approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans will also see the
OL,7,Frefurbishment of a public toilet at the
OL,8,Fsite, along with the creation of roof
OL,9,Fseating, a first-floor terrace at the
OL,10,Ffront of the building and recessed
OL,11,Fterrace below.
